  "worked_solution": "We differentiate the function, applying the addition, constant multiple, and power rules:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{\u2032}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-{x}^{3}-3{x}^{2}+24x-7) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-{x}^{3})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-3{x}^{2})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(24x)+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-7) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{3})-3\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{2})+24\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x)-7\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(1) \\\\  & =-3{x}^{(3-1)}-3\\cdot 2{x}^{(2-1)}+24\\cdot 1-7\\cdot 0 \\\\  & =-3{x}^{2}-6x+24\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
